  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/10/LesCulleres.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 332px;\" /></p>\n<p>(15 fotos) Este viernes abre sus puertas el restaurante Les Culleres, en la calle San Isidro, 12, en pleno centro hist&oacute;rico de Onda, detr&aacute;s de la Font de Dins, en una antigua panader&iacute;a de la que todav&iacute;a se conserva su horno medieval.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/10/IMG_4672.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Este jueves, las dos responsables han invitado a sus amistades a conocer el local, con varias estancias.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/restaurantlesculleres/img_4662.jpg\" alt=\"img_4662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/restaurantlesculleres/img_4663.jpg\" alt=\"img_4663\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/restaurantlesculleres/img_4665.jpg\" alt=\"img_4665\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/restaurantlesculleres/img_4669.jpg\" alt=\"img_4669\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/restaurantlesculleres/img_4671.jpg\" alt=\"img_4671\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/restaurantlesculleres/img_4672.jpg\" alt=\"img_4672\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/restaurantlesculleres/img_4674.jpg\" alt=\"img_4674\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/restaurantlesculleres/img_4679.jpg\" alt=\"img_4679\" style=